    special_tags: ()
    header_padding: '0'
    comment: 'STOCK BLOCK: cuts the frame. The trigger of the synchroniser (122 samples after the start of the STS) starts it; after the guard interval of 16 samples the 2 header symbols (the windows at s0 + 138, a training symbol read 10 samples late, and s0 + 218, the second training symbol) go to output 0, then it waits for the message ''header_data'' (always 44 symbols) and the 44 data symbols (the windows at s0 + 298 + 80 l) go to output 1'
  states:
