- parameters:
    value: '[0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), 0j, (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (-0.707106781187-0.707106781187j), (0.707106781187+0.707106781187j),
      (0.707106781187+0.707106781187j), 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j, 0j]'
    comment: 'the training symbol as the channel estimator must see it: the 28 QPSK values of T times (-j)^k. The first header window of the demux starts at s0 + 138, ten samples into the LTS (the LTS is T repeated, so the window is T shifted circularly by 42 samples: a phase slope of 42 samples); the data windows start 6 samples inside their prefixes (a slope of -6 samples). The factor exp(j 2 pi k 48 / 64) = (-j)^k is the sum of the two, so that H = received / sync word has the phase slope of the data windows'
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
